  "evidence": {
    "scope": "Primary-text context and same-ID usage split; no base draft edits.",
    "rationaleJa": "JOS13:31で「マナセの子マキル」と個人の系譜参照が部族baseより後に出る。17:1–3は同一段落内で部族の相続地・族祖個人・子孫の系譜を併記するため、集団baseと同じIDの個人contextを分離する。",
    "primaryWitnesses": [
      {
        "ref": "JOS 13:31 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS13.htm#V31",
        "text": "Half Gilead, Ashtaroth, and Edrei, the cities of the kingdom of Og in Bashan, were for the children of Machir the son of Manasseh, even for the half of the children of Machir according to their families.",
        "textSHA256": "566164b930237b89833813ea53f7e7a215ac51ddc1683b8b6a0d1f4c59aa2d76",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 17:1 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS17.htm#V1",
        "text": "This was the lot for the tribe of Manasseh, for he was the firstborn of Joseph. As for Machir the firstborn of Manasseh, the father of Gilead, because he was a man of war, therefore he had Gilead and Bashan.",
        "textSHA256": "b49ff5730450d4133b2c2dcfe552c440ce8000a4b4eff10a3406dc41a6dc8d21",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 17:2 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS17.htm#V2",
        "text": "So this was for the rest of the children of Manasseh according to their families: for the children of Abiezer, for the children of Helek, for the children of Asriel, for the children of Shechem, for the children of Hepher, and for the children of Shemida. These were the male children of Manasseh the son of Joseph according to their families.",
        "textSHA256": "fc8c8e78d9293d3ca2e02fdf8db2d1b8f85e12d76d62c37247eabb9bb3ccfdbb",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      },
      {
        "ref": "JOS 17:3 (WEB)",
        "url": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/JOS17.htm#V3",
        "text": "But Zelophehad, the son of Hepher, the son of Gilead, the son of Machir, the son of Manasseh, had no sons, but daughters. These are the names of his daughters: Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, and Tirzah.",
        "textSHA256": "41a5fb0cf9355252f8a4975fb421165de6b3d190a756f0585b7432c02bc9cea2",
        "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceId": "webp"
      }
